OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the woman helping abuse
OL,4,Avictims stay active
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gym in Worcestershire has started
OL,7,Foffering free exercise classes for
OL,8,Fwomen who have experienced domestic
OL,9,Fabuse.
OL,11,FIt is the brainchild of Chloe
OL,12,FCartwright, an accountant from
OL,13,FBirmingham, who said there was a
OL,14,F"missing gap" in support for victims,
OL,15,Fwith classes designed to help rebuild
OL,16,Fconfidence and improve mental
OL,17,Fwellbeing.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
