OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the woman helping abuse
OL,4,Avictims stay active
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 27-year-old said her self-funded
OL,7,FLift The Weight sessions would start at
OL,8,FValhalla Gym in Redditch at the end of
OL,9,FSeptember, with 20 women signing up
OL,10,Fwithin 24 hours of applications
OL,11,Fopening.
OL,13,F"The response I've had from people has
OL,14,Fjust motivated me to keep going and
OL,15,Fkeep doing it," she said, adding: "I've
OL,16,Frealised how much of a need there is
OL,17,Ffor something like this."
